# 5. USER SYSTEM

The system supports these core roles:

* Super Admin
* Principal
* Teacher
* Student

Current role constants:

super_admin
principal
teacher
student

Every authenticated request must identify the current user.

Core user fields:

* fullName
* email
* phone
* password
* role
* branchId
* isActive
* createdAt
* updatedAt

Passwords must NEVER be stored as plain text.

