# 8. PERMISSION SYSTEM

Permissions provide more granular authorization.

Permission format:

resource.action

Examples:

students.view
students.create
students.update
students.delete

teachers.view
teachers.create
teachers.update
teachers.delete

attendance.view
attendance.manage

exams.view
exams.manage

results.view
results.manage

finance.view
finance.manage

reports.view

Architecture:

permissions.ts
↓
Permission definitions

rolePermissions.ts
↓
Role → Permission mapping

permission.middleware.ts
↓
requirePermission()

Authorization flow:

JWT
↓
Authentication
↓
User Role
↓
Role Permissions
↓
Required Permission
↓
Allow / Deny

