# 9. BRANCH SCOPING

Branches are independent school campuses/branches.

Example:

Branch A
Branch B
Branch C

A user associated with Branch A must not access Branch B data unless explicitly authorized.

Branch-aware entities should contain:

branchId

Branch isolation must be enforced at the backend level.

NEVER rely only on React Native UI hiding.

Every branch-sensitive API must verify branch ownership/scope.

Target architecture:

Authentication
↓
Role
↓
Permission
↓
Branch Scope
↓
Controller
↓
Database Query

